# The Web/ workspace is SOURCE-ONLY (Fab marketplace rules: no node_modules, no
# binaries, no build output committed). Everything below is reproducible from the
# committed sources by `npm install` + `node Web/packages/cli/bin/vacuus.mjs build`.
node_modules/
dist/
package-lock.json
*.tsbuildinfo

# The smoke script's create/build roundtrip scaffolds a throwaway app under
# apps/ (it must sit inside the workspace so @vacuus/preact resolves) and
# deletes it; a run that dies mid-way must not leave it committable.
apps/smoketest/

